{"ts":1778346372478,"state_hash":"fb02b8f792100520","passage":"Canvas_scene_yard_frank_mending_fence_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: Yard — Frank with the fence (scene_yard_frank_mending_fence) | Node: Yard — Frank with the fence\n\n\n\n\nFrank's at the fence post by the gate, crouched with a coil of wire. He looks up.\n\nFrank: Hold this for me.\n\nHe hands you the wire. You hold it taut while he twists the loose end around the post with pliers. Done in a minute.\n\nFrank: Appreciate it.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHead back inside.","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Yard — Frank with the fence <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(scene_yard_frank_mending_fence)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Yard — Frank with the fence</div><br><br><p>Frank's at the fence post by the gate, crouched with a coil of wire. He looks up.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Hold this for me.</div></div><p>He hands you the wire. You hold it taut while he twists the loose end around the post with pliers. Done in a minute.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Appreciate it.</div></div><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a data-passage=\"Location_Back_Yard\" class=\"link-internal\" tabindex=\"0\">Head back inside.</a>","modal_text":"Are you sure that you want to restart? Unsaved progress will be lost.\n\nOKCancel","variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passa