{"ts":1778346390015,"state_hash":"b18bea555df17041","passage":"Canvas_scene_office_frank_diana_call_intercept_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: Frank's office — Diana on the phone (scene_office_frank_diana_call_intercept) | Node: Frank's office — Diana on the phone\n\n\n\nYou push the door open. Frank's at the desk with the phone to his ear. He raises a hand without looking — wait.\n\nFrank: I told you I don't know yet.\n\nPause. Whoever's on the line says something. He shifts the phone.\n\nFrank: Don't bring her name into it.\n\nAnother pause. Longer. He glances at you in the doorway and the line of his jaw tightens.\n\nFrank: Tomorrow.\n\nHe hangs up. Doesn't explain. Sets the receiver down with one finger, slow.\n\nFrank: Come back later.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPull the door closed.","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Frank's office — Diana on the phone <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(scene_office_frank_diana_call_intercept)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Frank's office — Diana on the phone</div><br><p>You push the door open. Frank's at the desk with the phone to his ear. He raises a hand without looking — wait.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> I told you I don't know yet.</div></div><p>Pause. Whoever's on the line says something. He shifts the phone.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Don't bring her name into it.</div></div><p>Another pause. Longer. He glances at you in the doorway and the line of his jaw tightens.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Tomorrow.</div></div><p>He hangs up. Doesn't explain. Sets the receiver down with one finger, slow.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Come back later.</div></div><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a data-passage=\"Location_Frank's_Office\" class=\"link-internal\" tabindex=\"0\">Pull the door closed.</a>","modal_text":"Are you sure that you want to restart? Unsaved progress will be lost.\n\nOKCancel","variables_snapshot":{"last_game_passage":"Canvas_scene_office_frank_diana_call_intercept_Node_1","player":{"name":"Maya","portrait":"maya.jpg","current_location":"","core_traits":{"energy":100,"hygiene":100,"fitness":30,"beauty":40,"corruption":22,"calculation":21,"money":400,"rep_church":0,"rep_road":0,"rep_college":0,"npc_frank_stage":3,"npc_ryan_stage":0,"npc_jake_stage":0,"ryan_help_count":0,"jake_peek_count":0,"lean_by_desk_count":0}},"npcs":{"037565c7-2846-482c-802e-36997e9b0701":{"name":"Frank","portrait":"frank.jpg","core_traits":{"love":2,"trust":13,"corruption":0,"arousal":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"178ef590-1f83-4eb2-8059-9996eb9e3189":{"name":"Ryan","portrait":"ryan.jpg","core_traits":{"love":0,"trust":5,"corruption":0,"arousal":0},"flags":{},"schedule":[],"relationship":""},"100e9212-d75b-44e9-b0f6-742f09ad3