{"ts":1778346398217,"state_hash":"265b3cf04e293cd0","passage":"Canvas_scene_hallway_frank_late_drink_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: Hallway — Frank with the bourbon (scene_hallway_frank_late_drink) | Node: Hallway — Frank with the bourbon\n\n\n\nYou turn the corner toward your room. The hallway's dark — only the window at the end giving any light.\n\nFrank's there. Standing by the window with a low glass in his hand. He doesn't move when you come around the corner.\n\nFrank: Couldn't sleep.\n\nHe sets the glass on the windowsill. Doesn't look at you. Doesn't say anything else. The two of you stand a moment in the dark hallway with the windowsill between you.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGo to your room.","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Hallway — Frank with the bourbon <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(scene_hallway_frank_late_drink)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Hallway — Frank with the bourbon</div><br><p>You turn the corner toward your room. The hallway's dark — only the window at the end giving any light.</p><p>Frank's there. Standing by the window with a low glass in his hand. He doesn't move when you come around the corner.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Couldn't sleep.</div></div><p>He sets the glass on the windowsill. Doesn't look at you. Doesn't say anything else. The two of you stand a moment in the dark hallway with the windowsill between you.</p><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a data-passage=\"Location_Home\" class=\"link-internal\" tabindex=\"0\">Go to your room.</a>","modal_text":"Are you sure that you want to restart? Unsaved progress will be lost.\n\nOKCancel","variables_snapshot":{"last_game_pa