{"ts":1778346406862,"state_hash":"1bfafaf1c3d65718","passage":"Canvas_scene_kitchen_frank_afternoon_alone_Node_1","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"Canvas: Kitchen — Frank, afternoon, no Diana (scene_kitchen_frank_afternoon_alone) | Node: Kitchen — Frank, afternoon, no Diana\n\n\n\n\nFrank at the table. House quiet — Diana at the church board until five. He sets the mug down when you come in.\n\nFrank: Come here.\n\nYou go. He pulls you into his lap at the kitchen table. Brief — just enough to feel the wood of the chair under both of you and his hand under your shirt and his ear cocked toward the driveway.\n\nFrank: Truck.\n\nYou hear it too. You're up before the engine's done idling.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHear the truck. Get up.","body_html":"<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Kitchen — Frank, afternoon, no Diana <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(scene_kitchen_frank_afternoon_alone)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Kitchen — Frank, afternoon, no Diana</div><br><br><p>Frank at the table. House quiet — Diana at the church board until five. He sets the mug down when you come in.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</strong> Come here.</div></div><p>You go. He pulls you into his lap at the kitchen table. Brief — just enough to feel the wood of the chair under both of you and his hand under your shirt and his ear cocked toward the driveway.</p><div class=\"dialog-block dialog-npc\"><div class=\"portrait\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></circle><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"85\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></ellipse></svg></div><div class=\"dialog-content\"><strong>Frank:</st